---
layout: broadcast.njk
title: Home
description: Kevin Franz Jr. — 6'1" / 190 lb SG/SF, Class of 2028 at Shawnee Mission West, club ball with JC Hoops 16U. 3.85 GPA and a full-time college course load at JCCC. Stats, film, academics, and recruiting contact.
active: home
---

{%- set current = (seasons.seasons | hasValue("isCurrent")) | first -%}
{%- set jv = jvSeason -%}
{%- set recentSeasons = seasons.seasons | limit(5) -%}

{# ===== HERO ===== #}
<section class="b-hero">
  <div class="b-hero-jersey-num">{{ player.jersey }}</div>
  <div class="b-hero-grid">
    <div class="b-hero-left">
      <div>
        <div class="b-hero-eyebrow">
          <span>CLASS OF {{ player.class }}</span>
          <span>{{ player.position }}</span>
          <span>{{ player.location | upper }}</span>
        </div>
        <h1>
          <span>Kevin Franz</span>
          <span class="b-stroke">Junior.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="b-hero-sub">
          {{ player.height }} / {{ player.weight }} lb {{ player.positionLong | lower }} at {{ player.highSchool }}. Pace, playmaking, and full-court defense &mdash; chasing college basketball and a degree in atmospheric science.
        </p>
        <div class="b-hero-cta-row">
          <a href="/basketball/" class="b-btn-primary">View Profile &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="b-btn-ghost">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% if current %}
      <div class="b-highlights">
        <span class="b-highlights-lead">&bull; {{ current.season | upper }}</span>
        <span><strong>{{ current.ppg }}</strong> PPG</span>
        <span><strong>{{ current.rpg }}</strong> RPG</span>
        <span><strong>{{ current.apg }}</strong> APG</span>
        <span><strong>{{ current.tpPct }}</strong> 3PT</span>
        <span>{{ current.team }} <strong>{{ current.record }}</strong></span>
        <span><strong>{{ player.gpa }}</strong> GPA</span>
        <span>Full-time college student at {{ dualEnrollment.collegeShort }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="b-hero-image">
      <img src="/images/player/medium_Copy_of_618_A3075_2_Enhanced_NR_0a0a68195a.jpg"
           alt="{{ player.name }} in a game jersey" width="800" height="1000">
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="b-hero-stat-strip b-hero-stat-strip--7">
    {% set heroStats = [
      ['HT', player.height],
      ['WT', player.weight + ' lb'],
      ['POS', player.position],
      ['#', player.jersey],
      ['SHOOTS', player.hand],
      ['GPA', player.gpa],
      ['CLASS', "'" + (player.class | replace('20','')) ]
    ] %}
    {% for cell in heroStats %}
      <div class="b-stat-cell">
        <div class="b-stat-cell-label">{{ cell[0] }}</div>
        <div class="b-stat-cell-value">{{ cell[1] }}</div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== PILLARS ===== #}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/01 PILLARS</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">Three<br>at once.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="/basketball/" class="b-section-cta">VIEW ALL &rarr;</a>
</div>
<section class="b-pillars">
  <div class="b-pillar">
    <div class="b-pillar-tag">/ BASKETBALL</div>
    <h3>Wing<br>scorer.</h3>
    <p>#{{ player.jersey }} &mdash; {{ player.positionLong }}. Pace, decisions, on-ball defense.{% if current %} {{ current.season }} with {{ current.team }}: {{ current.ppg }} PPG &middot; {{ current.rpg }} RPG &middot; {{ current.apg }} APG over {{ current.gp }} games.{% endif %}</p>
    <a href="/basketball/" class="b-pillar-link">Full profile</a>
  </div>
  <div class="b-pillar">
    <div class="b-pillar-tag">/ ACADEMICS</div>
    <h3>{{ player.gpa }} GPA.</h3>
    <p>{{ player.gpa }} {{ player.gpaLabel }} GPA with a heavy math and science load at {{ player.highSchool }}. Plan to study meteorology / atmospheric science.</p>
    <a href="/academics/" class="b-pillar-link">Coursework</a>
  </div>
  <div class="b-pillar">
    <div class="b-pillar-tag">/ CHARACTER</div>
    <h3>Off the<br>floor.</h3>
    <p>Weather nerd, film-room junkie, and mentor to younger players. Leadership, family, and showing up.</p>
    <a href="/character/" class="b-pillar-link">More</a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== LAST FULL HIGH SCHOOL SEASON (primary stats view) ===== #}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/02 LAST FULL HS SEASON</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">{{ jv.season }}.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="/basketball/" class="b-section-cta">GAME-BY-GAME &rarr;</a>
</div>
<section class="b-season-band">
  <div>
    <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:24px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:-0.01em; color:var(--b-text);">
      {{ jv.team }} &middot; #{{ jv.jersey }}
      <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--b-mute); margin-left:10px;">FINAL &middot; TEAM {{ jv.record }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="b-season-band-line">
      <span><strong>{{ jv.totals.gp }}</strong> GP / <strong>{{ jv.totals.gs }}</strong> GS</span>
      <span><strong>{{ jv.averages.ppg | oneDp }}</strong> PPG</span>
      <span><strong>{{ jv.averages.rpg | oneDp }}</strong> RPG</span>
      <span><strong>{{ jv.averages.apg | oneDp }}</strong> APG</span>
      <span><strong>{{ jv.averages.spg | oneDp }}</strong> SPG</span>
      <span>FG <strong>{{ jv.averages.fgPct }}%</strong></span>
      <span>3PT <strong>{{ jv.averages.tpPct }}%</strong></span>
      <span>FT <strong>{{ jv.averages.ftPct }}%</strong></span>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--b-mute); margin:14px 0 0; max-width:620px;">
      Final season at {{ player.formerHighSchool }} before transferring to {{ player.highSchool }}. Kevin has individual stats in {{ jv.totals.gp }} of the team's {{ jv.gamesTotal }} games.
    </p>
  </div>
  <a href="/basketball/" class="b-btn-primary" style="white-space:nowrap;">Full season &rarr;</a>
</section>

{# ===== ABOUT — full-bleed image w/ overlay panel ===== #}
<section id="about" class="b-about" style="position:relative; min-height:660px; overflow:hidden; border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line);">
  <img src="/images/banner/large_Copy_of_618_A3237_2_Enhanced_NR_8707ac32b4.jpg"
       alt="Kevin Franz Jr. driving to the basket during a game"
       loading="lazy" style="width:100%; height:660px; object-fit:cover;">
  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--b-bg) 0%, rgba(11,13,16,0.7) 40%, transparent 70%);"></div>
  <div class="b-about-panel" style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; bottom:0; width:600px; max-width:94%; padding:64px 48px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;">
    <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:16px;">/03 PROFILE</div>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:56px; line-height:0.95; letter-spacing:-0.03em; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0; color:var(--b-text);">
      A wing who<br>plays the<br>
      <span style="-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--b-green-bright); -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">right way.</span>
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:24px; max-width:470px;">
      {{ player.bio }}
    </p>
    <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--b-line); padding-top:20px; margin-top:28px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-text);">
      &ldquo;Help my team win. Earn the chance to play college ball.&rdquo;
      <span style="display:block; color:var(--b-mute); font-size:10px; margin-top:8px;">&mdash; KEVIN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== JOURNEY — most recent tracked seasons ===== #}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/04 JOURNEY</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">{{ seasons.seasons | length }} tracked<br>seasons.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="/timeline/" class="b-section-cta">FULL TIMELINE &rarr;</a>
</div>
<section class="b-pillars b-grid-5" style="padding:1px 0;">
  {% for s in recentSeasons %}
    <div class="b-pillar" style="min-height:220px;">
      <div class="b-pillar-tag">{{ s.season }}{% if s.isCurrent %} &middot; CURRENT{% endif %}</div>
      <h3 style="font-size:18px;">{{ s.teamShort }}</h3>
      <p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.06em; line-height:1.9; color:var(--b-mute);">
        {% if s.jersey %}#{{ s.jersey }} &middot; {% endif %}{% if s.record != 'n/a' %}{{ s.record }} &middot; {% endif %}{{ s.gp }} GP<br>
        {{ s.ppg }} PPG &middot; {{ s.rpg }} RPG &middot; {{ s.apg }} APG
      </p>
      <a href="/timeline/" class="b-pillar-link">Timeline</a>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

{# ===== RECENT UPDATES ===== #}
{% set recentUpdates = collections.updates | limit(3) %}
{% if recentUpdates | length %}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/05 LATEST</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">Recent<br>updates.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="/updates/" class="b-section-cta">ALL UPDATES &rarr;</a>
</div>
<section class="b-pillars">
  {% for post in recentUpdates %}
    <div class="b-pillar">
      <div class="b-pillar-tag">{{ post.data.type or 'UPDATE' }}</div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}" style="display:block; color:var(--b-green-bright); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px;">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {{ post.data.summary }}
      </p>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="b-pillar-link">Read more</a>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{# ===== CTA / CONTACT ===== #}
<section style="padding:80px 48px; background:var(--b-bg); border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line);">
  <div class="b-split" style="gap:64px; align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:16px;">/06 CONTACT</div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:64px; line-height:0.95; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:-0.03em; margin:0;">
        For<br>coaches.
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:24px; max-width:440px;">
        Stats, film, and recruiting profiles live on the Basketball page. For direct inquiries, reach {{ player.parentName }} below.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
      <a href="mailto:{{ player.parentEmail }}" style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:24px 28px; background:var(--b-green); color:white; text-decoration:none; align-items:center; clip-path:polygon(2% 0, 100% 0, 98% 100%, 0% 100%);">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.75; margin-bottom:6px;">EMAIL &rarr;</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:20px; word-break:break-word;">{{ player.parentEmail }}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="tel:{{ player.parentPhone | replace('-','') }}" style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:24px 28px; background:var(--b-bg-2); border:1px solid var(--b-line); color:var(--b-text); text-decoration:none; align-items:center;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-mute); margin-bottom:6px;">PHONE &rarr;</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:22px;">{{ player.parentPhone }}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
